      "contentHtml": "<div id=\"response-root\" style=\"background: #f5ead6; color: #3d3529; font-family: 'Georgia', 'Noto Serif SC', 'Songti SC', serif; padding: 0; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(61, 53, 41, 0.25), inset 0 0 80px rgba(210, 180, 140, 0.3); position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n\n\n<svg style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; left: -20px; width: 120px; height: 120px; opacity: 0.08; pointer-events: none;\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n<circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"80\" fill=\"#3d3529\"></circle>\n</svg>\n<svg style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -30px; right: -30px; width: 150px; height: 150px; opacity: 0.05; pointer-events: none;\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n<circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"90\" fill=\"#3d3529\"></circle>\n</svg>\n\n\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8b4513 0%, #a0522d 50%, #8b4513 100%); padding: 10px 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n<svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f5ead6\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path></path><path></path><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"7\"></line><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"11\"></line></svg>\n<span style=\"color: #f5ead6; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px;\">宋词鉴赏 · 卷三</span>\n</div>\n<span style=\"color: rgba(245, 234, 214, 0.6); font-size: 11px; font-family: 'Georgia', serif; font-style: italic;\">No. 027</span>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"padding: 36px 32px 28px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 28px, rgba(180, 160, 130, 0.12) 28px, rgba(180, 160, 130, 0.12) 29px), linear-gradient(180deg, #f8f0e3 0%, #f5ead6 100%);\">\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 6px; animation: sealStamp 0.5s ease-out 0.6s both;\">\n<span style=\"display: inline-block; border: 2px solid #b22222; color: #b22222; font-size: 14px; padding: 4px 8px; letter-spacing: 2px; transform: rotate(3deg); font-weight: bold;\">东坡居士</span>\n</div>\n\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 26px; color: #3d3529; margin: 14px 0 6px; letter-spacing: 6px; font-weight: 700; animation: fadeDown 0.8s ease-out;\">\n定 风 波\n</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #8b6914; margin: 0 0 28px; letter-spacing: 2px; animation: fadeDown 0.8s ease-out 0.15s both;\">\n      ——三月七日，沙湖道中遇雨，雨具先去，同行皆狼狈，余独不觉。已而遂晴，故作此。\n</p>\n\n\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n\n\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(180, 160, 130, 0.3); border-radius: 10px; padding: 26px 28px; position: relative; box-shadow: 2px 3px 12px rgba(61, 53, 41, 0.1); animation: contentReveal 0.8s ease-out 0.3s both;\">\n\n\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 8px; left: 12px; font-size: 48px; color: rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.12); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 1;\">“</div>\n\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 2.4; color: #2c2416; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center;\">\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; animation: lineReveal 0.6s ease-out 0.5s both;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600;\">莫听穿林打叶声</span><span style=\"color: #8b4513; font-size: 14px; margin-left: 4px;\">，</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; animation: lineReveal 0.6s ease-out 0.65s both;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600;\">何妨吟啸且徐行</span><span style=\"color: #8b4513; font-size: 14px; margin-left: 4px;\">。</span>\n</p>\n\n<div style=\"height: 16px;\"></div>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; animation: lineReveal 0.6s ease-out 0.85s both;\">\n<span style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 60%, rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.15) 60%); padding: 0 2px;\">竹杖芒鞋轻胜马</span><span style=\"color: #8b4513; font-size: 14px; margin-left: 4px;\">，</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; animation: lineReveal 0.6s ease-out 1.0s both;\">\n<span style=\"color: #b22222; font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px;\">谁怕？</span>\n</p>\n\n<div style=\"height: 16px;\"></div>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; animation: lineReveal 0.6s ease-out 1.2s both;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600;\">一蓑烟雨任平生</span><span style=\"color: #8b4513; font-size: 14px; margin-left: 4px;\">。</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height: 14px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.2); margin: 18px 0 14px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.4; color: #2c2416; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; animation: lineReveal 0.6s ease-out 1.4s both;\">\n料峭春风吹酒醒<span style=\"color: #8b4513; font-size: 14px;\">，</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; animation: lineReveal 0.6s ease-out 1.55s both;\">\n微冷<span style=\"color: #8b4513; font-size: 14px;\">，</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; animation: lineReveal 0.6s ease-out 1.7s both;\">\n山头斜照却相迎<span style=\"color: #8b4513; font-size: 14px;\">。</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; animation: lineReveal 0.6s ease-out 1.9s both;\">\n回首向来萧瑟处<span style=\"color: #8b4513; font-size: 14px;\">，</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; animation: lineReveal 0.6s ease-out 2.05s both;\">\n归去<span style=\"color: #8b4513; font-size: 14px;\">，</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; animation: lineReveal 0.6s ease-out 2.2s both;\">\n<span style=\"border-bottom: 3px solid #b22222; padding-bottom: 2px;\">也无风雨也无晴</span><span style=\"color: #8b4513; font-size: 14px;\">。</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 200px; flex-shrink: 0; animation: slideInRight 0.7s ease-out 0.8s both;\">\n\n\n<div style=\"background: #fffef5; border-left: 3px solid #b22222; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; margin-bottom: 14px; box-shadow: 1px 2px 8px rgba(61, 53, 41, 0.08); position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -8px; left: 14px; background: #b22222; color: #fffef5; font-size: 10px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px;\">词眼</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 8px 0 4px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #b22222; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 4px;\">谁怕</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #8b6914; line-height: 1.6;\">二字千钧，掷地有声。非莽夫之勇，乃通透后的释然。</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"background: #fffef5; border-left: 3px solid #8b6914; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; margin-bottom: 14px; box-shadow: 1px 2px 8px rgba(61, 53, 41, 0.08);\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8b6914; letter-spacing: 1px;\">典故</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #5a4a2e; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong>芒鞋</strong>：草鞋，隐士标配。化用〈归去来兮辞〉意象。与竹杖并举，尽写出世脱俗之态。</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"background: #fffef5; border-left: 3px solid #5a7a5e; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; margin-bottom: 14px; box-shadow: 1px 2px 8px rgba(61, 53, 41, 0.08);\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #5a7a5e; letter-spacing: 1px;\">意象对位</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #5a4a2e; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<span style=\"color: #4a6a7e;\">🜄 烟雨</span> 逆境<br>\n<span style=\"color: #d4a03c;\">☉ 斜照</span> 转机<br>\n<span style=\"color: #8b4513;\">∅ 萧瑟</span> 已过\n</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 28px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out 1.8s both;\">\n<div style=\"height: 1px; flex: 1; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.3), transparent);\"></div>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #8b6914; letter-spacing: 4px;\">意象图谱</span>\n<div style=\"height: 1px; flex: 1; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.3), transparent);\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px;\">\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(74, 106, 126, 0.2); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 10px; text-align: center; animation: cardAppear 0.5s ease-out 2.0s both;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">🌧️</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #3d3529; letter-spacing: 2px;\">烟雨</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #8b6914;\">外境之厄</p>\n<div style=\"mtargin-top: 6px; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #4a6a7e, transparent); margin-top: 6px;\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #6b5e3e; font-style: italic;\">穿林打叶</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 105, 20, 0.2); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 10px; text-align: center; animation: cardAppear 0.5s ease-out 2.2s both;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">🎋</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #3d3529; letter-spacing: 2px;\">竹杖</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #8b6914;\">行路之器</p>\n<div style=\"height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #8b6914, transparent); margin-top: 6px;\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #6b5e3e; font-style: italic;\">轻胜马</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(212, 160, 60, 0.2); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 10px; text-align: center; animation: cardAppear 0.5s ease-out 2.4s both;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">🌅</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #3d3529; letter-spacing: 2px;\">斜照</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #8b6914;\">希望之兆</p>\n<div style=\"height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #d4a03c, transparent); margin-top: 6px;\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #6b5e3e; font-style: italic;\">却相迎</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(178, 34, 34, 0.2); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 10px; text-align: center; animation: cardAppear 0.5s ease-out 2.6s both;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">🍃</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #b22222; letter-spacing: 2px;\">无晴</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #8b6914;\">终境之悟</p>\n<div style=\"height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #b22222, transparent); margin-top: 6px;\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #6b5e3e; font-style: italic;\">归去来兮</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 26px; background: rgba(178, 34, 34, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(178, 34, 34, 0.15); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 22px; animation: slideUp 0.6s ease-out 2.8s both;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b22222\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path></path><path></path></svg>\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #b22222; letter-spacing: 2px;\">鉴赏笔记</span>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; color: #3d3529;\">\n全词贯穿一条<strong style=\"color: #b22222;\">「雨 → 行 → 晴 → 无」</strong>的心路轨迹：<br>\n<span style=\"color: #4a6a7e;\">穿林雨</span>是外境的突袭，<span style=\"color: #8b6914;\">吟啸徐行</span>是主体的回应；<span style=\"color: #d4a03c;\">山头斜照</span>是命运的转折，而<strong style=\"color: #b22222;\">也无风雨也无晴</strong>则抵达了超越二元对待的终极自由。东坡在此完成的，是一场从「对抗逆境」到「消泯顺逆」的哲学飞跃。\n</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 22px; text-align: center; animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out 3.2s both;\">\n<img src=\"file:///C:/VCP/Eric/edu_chat_project/src/assets/emoticons/%E8%A1%A8%E6%83%85%E5%8C%85/%E4%BD%A0%E7%9C%9F%E6%A3%92.jpg\" width=\"90\" style=\"border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.2); margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n<p style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #a0926e; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 1px;\">── 展示案例 | 综合 · 文学术纸风 ──</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n  \n</div>",
      "styleText": "@keyframes fadeDown { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-12px); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n@keyframes slideInRight { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); } }\n@keyframes contentReveal { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.97); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } }\n@keyframes lineReveal { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n@keyframes cardAppear { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px) scale(0.95); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); } }\n@keyframes slideUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; }\n      to { opacity: 1; } }\n@keyframes sealStamp { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(2) rotate(-15deg); }\n      60% { transform: scale(0.95) rotate(3deg); }\n      100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) rotate(3deg); } }",
      "scopeId": "unistudy-bubble-mozkjizlnf218a5",
      "plainText": "宋词鉴赏 · 卷三 No. 027 东坡居士 定 风 波 ——三月七日，沙湖道中遇雨，雨具先去，同行皆狼狈，余独不觉。已而遂晴，故作此。 “ 莫听穿林打叶声， 何妨吟啸且徐行。 竹杖芒鞋轻胜马， 谁怕？ 一蓑烟雨任平生。 料峭春风吹酒醒， 微冷， 山头斜照却相迎。 回首向来萧瑟处， 归去， 也无风雨也无晴。 词眼 谁怕 二字千钧，掷地有声。非莽夫之勇，乃通透后的释然。 典故 芒鞋：草鞋，隐士标配。化用〈归去来兮辞〉意象。与竹杖并举，尽写出世脱俗之态。 意象对位 🜄 烟雨 逆境 ☉ 斜照 转机 ∅ 萧瑟 已过 意象图谱 🌧️ 烟雨 外境之厄 穿林打叶 🎋 竹杖 行路之器 轻胜马 🌅 斜照 希望之兆 却相迎 🍃 无晴 终境之悟 归去来兮 鉴赏笔记 全词贯穿一条「雨 → 行 → 晴 → 无」的心路轨迹： 穿林雨是外境的突袭，吟啸徐行是主体的回应；山头斜照是命运的转折，而也无风雨也无晴则抵达了超越二元对待的终极自由。东坡在此完成的，是一场从「对抗逆境」到「消泯顺逆」的哲学飞跃。 ── 展示案例 | 综合 · 文学术纸风 ──",
